sentences.text:
The Order is downloaded from the DHC Server on 16/05/2024 at 00:16:52 without expressing any opinion on the merits of the case, petitioner is admitted to bail on furnishing personal bond in the sum of Rs.25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousand only) with one surety in the like amount to the satisfaction of the learned trial court and subject to the following conditions:
(i) Appellant shall provide his mobile number to the Investigating Officer (IO)/SHO concerned at the time of release;
(ii) In case of change of address, appellant shall intimate/communicate his address to the IO/SHO concerned;
(iii) Appellant shall not influence the witnesses in any manner.

